; authlogin.dll's exports (EA.Com's login component, 2002-07-17, 3.3.0.6), exactly as exported (D90 9a).
; Both undecorated: VC6's `lib /def` imports them by name. The client imports only
; AuthLoginLib_GetComponentFactory. Build: python tools/vc6/mkauthlogin.py (docs/toolchain.md 2).
LIBRARY authlogin.dll
EXPORTS
  AuthLoginLib_GetAuthorize
  AuthLoginLib_GetComponentFactory
